# Aurex Corp VTT

> A lightweight virtual tabletop designed for Game Masters who want complete control without the complexity of a full-featured VTT.

## Project Goals

Aurex Corp VTT is a personal project focused on providing a simple, self-hosted display system for tabletop RPGs.

The project intentionally avoids trying to compete with platforms like Roll20 or Foundry. Instead, it focuses on solving a specific problem:

* One control panel for the GM
* One clean display for players
* Simple battle management
* Local-first architecture
* Easy future deployment for remote games

The application should feel more like a "stream deck for tabletop games" than a traditional VTT.

---

## Design Philosophy

* Keep the code approachable.
* Build features only when they solve a real problem.
* Favor modular systems over hardcoded pages.
* Local-first, cloud-ready.
* Player display should remain clean and distraction-free.

