## Planned Features

### Scene Display

* Background artwork
* Battle maps
* Scene transitions

### Initiative

* Combat order
* Current turn
* On deck
* Hidden GM information

### Trackers

Reusable widgets such as:

* Round counter
* Torch timer
* Party resources
* Countdown timers
* Boss phases

Each tracker can independently be:

* hidden
* public
* GM-only

### Session Management

Future versions will support:

* shareable player links
* GM control links
* multiple simultaneous sessions
* optional cloud hosting

